@thibmeu pointed out to me today that, modulo reverse Privacy Pass, this notion of token types for IHAT and ACT corresponds exactly to "MoLE endorsements" and "MoLE credentials" in the protocols draft:
https://moderation-of-unlinkable-endorsements.github.io/internet-drafts/draft-jms-mole-protocols.html#section-9

What the protocols draft does today is already what I had in mind, except for potentially bikeshedding on naming, which I'm happy to save for later.

```suggestion
# Performance {#performance}
{:numbered="false"}
```
